{"change_summary":"Rechecked the pending amendment list against current `tank_tui` HEAD and found the runtime fixes already present: legacy chemistry alias normalization was already wired into snapshot parsing, and the overview screen already labeled the 7-ion TDS/conductivity values as estimates. The remaining gap was coverage, so I extended `crates/tank_tui/src/api_client.rs` with a regression test that proves `/load` responses containing only legacy chemistry field names still deserialize into `TankSnapshot` correctly.","outstanding_risks":["The pending amendment list was stale relative to current HEAD, so this round only added regression coverage rather than changing runtime behavior.","Validation in this round was targeted to the touched compatibility and overview paths plus `cargo check -p tank_tui`; I did not rerun the full `cargo test -p tank_tui` suite.","Untracked `.ralph-burning/` workspace artifacts remain in the repository root and were left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Compared the pending amendment list with the current `tank_tui` snapshot parsing and overview rendering code to determine what still differed from HEAD.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Confirmed the TUI already normalized legacy chemistry aliases for snapshot deserialization and already labeled overview TDS/conductivity values as estimates, so no additional runtime patch was needed for those paths.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Extended the `api_client` compatibility tests so the legacy snapshot fixture is reusable by seed and added a `/load` regression proving nested legacy chemistry payloads deserialize successfully.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran targeted formatting and validation for the compatibility and overview paths after the test update.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all -- crates/tank_tui/src/api_client.rs` completed successfully.","`cargo test -p tank_tui api_client::tests --lib` passed (3 tests), covering direct legacy snapshot parsing, canonical-over-legacy precedence, and `/load` nested snapshot compatibility.","`cargo test -p tank_tui screens::overview::tests::overview_labels_tds_and_conductivity_as_estimates --lib` passed.","`cargo check -p tank_tui` passed."]}